infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Same JSON schema, two pipelines
  desc Audit and operational logs share the format and trace_id but diverge on three axes — mixing them in one index is a compliance failure
  compares
    - label Operational logs
      children
        - label Retention 7-90 days
          desc Hot / warm / cold tiers, then deleted
        - label Deletable
          desc Retention policy, right-to-erasure, cost control
        - label Dev-team readable
          desc Anyone with log search, for incident response
        - label Answers why is it slow
          desc Wide schema, event-specific attributes
    - label Audit logs
      children
        - label Retention 1-7 years
          desc SOC 2: 1 year; HIPAA / PCI DSS: 7 years
        - label Append-only
          desc Hash-chained or signed so tampering is detectable
        - label Narrow access
          desc Security team + auditors, with audit-of-audits
        - label Answers who did what
          desc Narrow schema: who, what, when, resource, outcome
theme
  palette #0ea5e9 #f43f5e
